WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/layout/status-bar/ConnectionSegment.tsx — a footer status-bar API-health segment:
    useApiHealth() → { status ∈ ok|degraded|offline|unknown, latencyMs: number|null }
    <Tooltip><Link to="/system-status">  dot(v.dot) + Icon(v.icon) + (!iconOnly: short "API" + trailer) </Link></Tooltip>
    variants: ok=Online/emerald/Activity · degraded=Degraded/amber/AlertTriangle ·
              offline=Offline/rose/CircleSlash · unknown=Connecting…/muted/HelpCircle
    inline trailer  : ok|degraded & latency → "· {ms}ms" · offline → "· Offline" · unknown → (nothing)
    tooltip         : "API connection · {state}" + (latency & status!==offline → " · {ms}ms")
    aria-label      : "API connection status: {state}" + (latency & status!==offline → " ({ms}ms)")
  Colour is deliberately paired with an icon so the state is legible under colour-vision differences.

